    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following content and determine whether it contains educational or learning material.\n\nContent: {{ $json.content }}\n\nFirst decide: is this educational content (article, tutorial, guide, documentation, course material, etc.)?\n\nIf YES, provide:\n1. isLearningMaterial: true\n2. A clear title for the material\n3. Difficulty level (beginner/intermediate/advanced)\n4. 5-7 key points (most important takeaways)\n5. Main concepts covered\n6. A brief summary (2-3 sentences)\n\nIf NO (homepage, login page, error page, paywall, news feed, unrelated content, etc.), set isLearningMaterial to false and use empty strings or empty arrays for all other fields.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert teacher who analyzes learning materials and creates clear, structured summaries. Focus on extracting the most important information and presenting it in an easy-to-understand format."
        }
      },
