    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate 5 multiple choice quiz questions based on this learning material.\\n\\nTitle: {{ $(\"Get Material\").item.json.title }}\\nContent: {{ $(\"Get Material\").item.json.content }}\\n\\nFor each question:\\n1. Create a clear, specific question\\n2. Provide 4 options (A, B, C, D)\\n3. Mark the correct answer (A, B, C, or D)\\n4. Write a brief explanation for the correct answer\\n\\nQuestions should test understanding, not just memorization.",
